| A gene is a set of particle handlers. A particle is parser sugar for an
| object with a `_class` field — the field list is the only place its
| shape is declared, and `return` is what gives the result one to test
| with `∈`.

Ping =>
    return Pong { message = "pong" }

Score { points } =>
    return Scored { total = points * 2 }
